    source('healing_splash','Native splash Healing I/II','minecraft:indirect_magic','int(intensity*(6<<amp)+0.5)>2','direct potion / thrower (null for native dispenser)','Lich is skeletons -> undead -> inverted_healing_and_harm, so HEALING damages and HARMING heals. Potion server splash AABB4/2/4, squared distance<16, isAffectedByPotions; direct target intensity1 else1-distance/4. Native amp0/1 full-hit amounts6/12; distant rounded<=2 fails. No arrow hurt prerequisite.',labels=['THROWN_PROJECTILE','AOE'])
